## Service.cs (T3) + InProcessClient.cs audit

- Service implements IService + IDisposable. Owns command-handler registry, routes
  ExecuteAsync to registered handlers via IMainThreadDispatcher.InvokeAsync.
- Built-in "world.orchestrate" command delegates inner CommandRequest to IWorldOrchestration.
- No App.Agent/App.Stage/Hermes. PASS.
- InProcessClient implements IClient; routes Health/Status/Command to IService. Restored
  prior-art pattern. PASS.

